# Dr. Denys Dutykh (Mathematics Department, Khalifa University of Science and Technology, Abu Dhabi, UAE)
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "my-cli-config: a Claude Code status line, a Starship prompt, a Ghostty terminal and a tmux configuration, installed by symlink"
type: software
